= Collaboration without the noise

#html.img(src: "/assets/release-2-0.jpg", alt: "A geometric office interior arranged for collaboration")

Relay 2.0 reorganizes the product around the work a team is trying to finish,
not around a stream of notifications.

== New Features & Enhancements

- *Focused home:* See active decisions, assigned work, and blocked handoffs.
- *Offline drafts:* Write notes and comments before a connection is available.
- *Notification windows:* Choose when non-urgent summaries arrive.

== Bug Fixes

- Fixed conflicting edits when a sleeping device reconnects.
- Improved screen-reader announcements for status changes.
- Preserved scroll position when returning from a task.
- Added recovery guidance to synchronization errors.

== Coming Soon

- *Shared templates:* Reusable project structures without hidden automation.
- *Public notes:* Read-only publishing for decisions and release plans.
- *Import tools:* Bring structured work from common file formats.
